## Scope of this license

The MIT terms above cover the code and documentation in this repository: the
MCP servers, API clients, verification scripts, tests and skill definitions.

They do not cover, and this project does not grant any rights to:

- The video generation models (Doubao Seedance, Tongyi Wanxiang / Wan) or their
  outputs. These are operated by their respective providers.
- The API gateway this software talks to, or access credentials for it.
- Any video generated through this software.

## Conditions of use

Using this software requires your own API credentials from a gateway that
serves the video endpoints. No credentials are included or implied, and this
project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by any model provider
or gateway operator.

You are responsible for:

- Obtaining credentials legitimately and keeping them secret.
- Complying with the acceptable use policy and terms of the gateway and the
  upstream model providers.
- All charges incurred. Video generation is billed per render and scales with
  duration, resolution and model tier.
- The content you generate, and the rights to any reference images, video or
  audio you supply as input.
- Complying with applicable law, including disclosure requirements for
  synthetic media where they apply in your jurisdiction.

Generated video is the responsibility of the person who requested it. Do not
use this software to produce content that infringes third-party rights,
impersonates real people without consent, or violates the providers' policies.
